623
01:06:42,469 --> 01:06:43,470
Right on!

624
01:06:43,571 --> 01:06:44,471
One more trawl?

625
01:06:44,572 --> 01:06:45,807
Then 'ome t'Mother!

626
01:06:45,907 --> 01:06:47,374
Weee-ooo!

627
01:06:51,144 --> 01:06:53,581
(chugging, clanging)

628
01:07:07,829 --> 01:07:09,664
