629
01:07:11,733 --> 01:07:13,601
(churning, creaking)

630
01:07:16,103 --> 01:07:17,705
(motor chugging)

631
01:07:18,740 --> 01:07:20,307
(sea sploshing)

632
01:07:21,275 --> 01:07:23,210
(straining, groaning)

633
01:07:37,792 --> 01:07:39,027
What is it?

634
01:07:40,728 --> 01:07:41,829
Buggered!

635
01:07:49,837 --> 01:07:50,638
Ugh...

636
01:07:55,643 --> 01:07:57,110
(hammer clangs)

637
01:08:00,982 --> 01:08:04,418
