MIKE: You know, there's always
a wanker on the crew.

683
01:13:10,825 --> 01:13:13,160
An' if you can't spot'm,
can't spot'm...

684
01:13:14,095 --> 01:13:15,495
then it must be you.

685
01:13:15,596 --> 01:13:17,999
An' if you can't spot'm,
can't spot'm...

686
01:13:18,099 --> 01:13:19,466
Get this sorted, shall us?

687
01:13:21,002 --> 01:13:22,536
You should get yourself
a girlfriend.

688
01:13:22,637 --> 01:13:24,071
Get this sorted, shall us?

689
01:13:24,171 --> 01:13:26,674
An' if you can't spot'm...

690
01:13:27,407 --> 01:13:29,010
Get this sorted, shall us?

691
01:13:29,110 --> 01:13:30,711
(electronic whirring)

692
01:13:38,119 --> 01:13:39,754
(low rumble)

693
01:13:47,395 --> 01:13:49,163
(clattering)

694
01:13:59,273 --> 01:14:01,008
(truck engine starts)

695
01:14:11,218 --> 01:14:12,720
(gears grind)
(engine revs)

696
01:14:24,699 --> 01:14:27,101
(gravel churns, crunches)

697
01:14:27,201 --> 01:14:28,836
(leaves rustling)

698
01:14:39,479 --> 01:14:40,848
(tyres screeching)

699
01:14:50,291 --> 01:14:51,892
