for now.

728
01:17:02,156 --> 01:17:04,125
What you're doin's
prob'ly illegal.

729
01:17:09,864 --> 01:17:12,299
An' if it idn',
it's still pretty bleak.

730
01:17:14,468 --> 01:17:16,070
(dark music)

731
01:17:20,774 --> 01:17:22,643
(boat rumbling)

732
01:17:28,482 --> 01:17:30,184
(gutting knife squelching)

733
01:17:36,757 --> 01:17:38,759
(seagull squawking)

734
01:17:39,860 --> 01:17:42,029
Push our luck, shall us, boys?

735
01:17:43,063 --> 01:17:45,199
Quick trawl before
the weather 'its.

736
01:17:46,535 --> 01:17:48,202
Yeeeooooww!

737
01:17:48,335 --> 01:17:50,204
(boat chugging)

738
01:17:53,140 --> 01:17:56,443
(thunder rumbles)
(heavy rain pelts down)

739
01:17:56,545 --> 01:17:58,078
(wind howls)

740
01:17:58,679 --> 01:18:00,314
(thunder cracks)

741
01:18:01,182 --> 01:18:02,683
(lamp rattling)

742
01:18:03,384 --> 01:18:04,653
(rain thrashing)

743
01:18:04,752 --> 01:18:06,253
(eerie music)

744
01:18:06,353 --> 01:18:07,888
(water sloshing)

745
01:18:09,023 --> 01:18:10,525
(rumbling, clattering, breaking)

746
01:18:10,625 --> 01:18:12,226
Here she comes!

747
01:18:13,294 --> 01:18:14,695
(wave crashes)

748
01:18:27,441 --> 01:18:29,076
(shouts) 'Old on, boys!

749
01:18:30,411 --> 01:18:31,845
(wave crashes violently)

750
01:18:31,946 --> 01:18:33,314
(clattering, clanging)

751
01:18:36,685 --> 01:18:38,385
(another wave crashes)

752
01:18:39,286 --> 01:18:40,754
(clattering)

753
01:18:40,854 --> 01:18:42,624
Watch out!
(wave crashes)

754
01:18:42,723 --> 01:18:44,458
(clattering, shattering)

755
01:18:44,858 --> 01:18:46,760
(creaking, splashing)

756
01:18:47,962 --> 01:18:49,363
MURGEY: Uh...c'mon...

757
01:18:50,331 --> 01:18:51,498
Jammed solid...

758
01:18:52,567 --> 01:18:54,268
C'mon, ya fuck!

759
01:18:54,401 --> 01:18:55,436
Argh!

760
01:18:55,537 --> 01:18:56,737
(rain pelting)

761
01:18:58,739 --> 01:19:00,274
(creaking, screeching)

762
01:19:02,343 --> 01:19:04,278
Tight as a bloody drum!

763
01:19:04,478 --> 01:19:06,213
(creaking, screeching)

764
01:19:08,349 --> 01:19:09,817
-Christ!
-What?!

765
01:19:09,917 --> 01:19:11,785
Warp's gone round the prop!

766
01:19:12,419 --> 01:19:13,622
What's that mean?!

767
01:19:13,754 --> 01:19:15,823
We're dead in the water, boys!

768
01:19:16,090 --> 01:19:18,292
(wave crashing)
(eerie music)

769
01:19:18,459 --> 01:19:20,294
Goin' broadside, we are!

770
01:19:20,394 --> 01:19:21,929
(loud creaking)

771
01:19:22,162 --> 01:19:24,298
If we don't free that prop...

772
01:19:24,498 --> 01:19:26,267
(another wave crashes)

773
01:19:26,900 --> 01:19:28,536
...we're done for!

774
01:19:30,070 --> 01:19:32,239
(wave crashes)
Hey!

775
01:19:35,309 --> 01:19:37,144
(screeching)

776
01:19:39,380 --> 01:19:40,914
(gurgling)

777
01:19:41,949 --> 01:19:43,884
(ominous music)

778
01:19:47,121 --> 01:19:48,322
Grab on!

779
01:19:48,422 --> 01:19:50,759
Grab hold of it!
-Argh!

780
01:19:50,858 --> 01:19:52,259
(heart beats)

781
01:19:52,359 --> 01:19:55,062
(splashing, gurgling)

782
01:19:55,896 --> 01:19:56,864
(heart beats)

783
01:19:56,964 --> 01:19:58,566
(splashing)
(gasping)

784
01:19:58,667 --> 01:20:00,034
C'mon!

785
01:20:01,268 --> 01:20:02,369
C'mon.

786
01:20:10,911 --> 01:20:12,813
Give me your hand!

787
01:20:18,118 --> 01:20:20,020
(rattling, clattering)

788
01:20:20,154 --> 01:20:21,322
There!

789
01:20:22,923 --> 01:20:24,391
(creaking, clattering)

790
01:20:24,793 --> 01:20:27,194
(rain pouring)
(creaking, metal screeching)

791
01:20:31,198 --> 01:20:32,499
Argh.

792
01:20:32,900 --> 01:20:34,301
(groans)

793
01:20:34,401 --> 01:20:35,903
(ominous music)

794
01:20:41,475 --> 01:20:44,579
(crack, snap)
(creaking, engine rumbles)

795
01:20:44,779 --> 01:20:47,214
(axe clatters)
(engine rumbling)

796
01:20:50,084 --> 01:20:52,986
(waves crashing)
Right on!

797
01:20:57,692 --> 01:20:59,493
(chaotic noise stills)

798
01:21:38,767 --> 01:21:40,067
Right.

799
01:21:40,602 --> 01:21:42,403
'Ome t'Mother.

800
01:21:42,503 --> 01:21:44,371
No net, no fish.

801
01:21:45,973 --> 01:21:49,109
Heroes to zeroes
in a dozen tides.

802
01:21:50,911 --> 01:21:53,213
Weem gonna
be the talk of the land.

803
01:22:04,992 --> 01:22:06,895
(pensive music)

804
01:22:31,519 --> 01:22:33,320
(scratching)

805
01:22:51,405 --> 01:22:53,173
(whooshing)

806
01:23:01,114 --> 01:23:03,050
(low rumble)

807
01:23:05,085 --> 01:23:06,019
LIAM: Can I go?

808
01:23:06,119 --> 01:23:07,622
MURGEY: Aye, go on.

809
01:23:07,822 --> 01:23:09,189
Alright, don't miss me.

810
01:23:14,896 --> 01:23:15,996
Lash-up!

811
01:23:16,129 --> 01:23:17,732
You ent on your own.

812
01:23:17,832 --> 01:23:18,733
Hi.

813
01:23:18,833 --> 01:23:19,868
Giz a kiss.

814
01:23:20,300 --> 01:23:22,035
(dramatic music)
Even the liars

815
01:23:22,135 --> 01:23:23,638
ent catching nuthin'.

816
01:23:25,807 --> 01:23:27,542
Least you're all in one piece.

817
01:23:28,877 --> 01:23:30,477
You catch 'er 'old tight!

818
01:23:31,980 --> 01:23:33,347
Hello, darling!

819
01:23:34,849 --> 01:23:36,283
Don't let her go, mind.

820
01:23:39,854 --> 01:23:41,121
There ya go.

821
01:23:42,489 --> 01:23:44,024
Thanks, Daddy.

822
01:23:47,160 --> 01:23:49,029
One, two, three, wahey!...

823
01:23:49,129 --> 01:23:51,298
(confounding music)

824
01:24:27,067 --> 01:24:28,636
(whooshing)

825
01:24:28,736 --> 01:24:29,971
(dark beat)

826
01:24:30,070 --> 01:24:31,639
(dramatic music)

827
01:25:53,387 --> 01:25:54,822
(car engine starts)

828
01:26:02,462 --> 01:26:05,198
TV: <i>73 degrees Fahrenheit.</i>
<i>Light winds.</i>

829
01:26:05,298 --> 01:26:06,934
<i>It will feel very pleasant.</i>

830
01:26:07,035 --> 01:26:08,201
<i>That's the forecast.</i>

831
01:26:08,435 --> 01:26:10,004
<i>This is the summary.</i>

832
01:26:10,404 --> 01:26:12,640
<i>Coming up shortly,</i>
<i>tonight's movie...</i>

833
01:26:12,740 --> 01:26:14,008
<i>Mineral Point.</i>

834
01:26:14,307 --> 01:26:16,176
<i>Every time you turn</i>
<i>on a light</i>

835
01:26:16,276 --> 01:26:18,311
<i>or turn the heating up</i>
<i>at night...</i>

836
01:26:18,412 --> 01:26:21,115
