837
01:26:21,214 --> 01:26:22,650
Can I tell you something?

838
01:26:30,992 --> 01:26:32,225
Can I?

839
01:26:34,028 --> 01:26:35,395
Madder do 'e?

840
01:26:38,533 --> 01:26:39,499
What?

841
01:26:41,102 --> 01:26:42,335
